    <item>
      <title>GPT-5“数学突破”风波：一场技术炒作对AI信任的“反噬”与科学范式的重塑</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/gpt-5ai-20251020181005050-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 18:10:05 +0800</pubDate>
